{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 44","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/007a93ae8547c0b9531c77b9d8af131b0a278fbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" /> are both real and greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787aad618996d66e35d4b4e90f610c4cd532f57f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=b+c+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/3/ab3fe007b2f6ea357deeee063de510e0ae56c670.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{may be less than zero}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{may be equal to zero}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"447\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0de4738b1cc23b43fb00d30f40239ec30d65543.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)} \\text{ must be greater than zero}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{must be less than zero}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\text{ must be between -1 and +1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"722\" height=\"18\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the roots of the quadratic be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Then, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f0a6e5ff1177716ccad335d0c1fa56adddb82b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-(p+q)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eae8b80e87a0390d8f871fdf0a11393f120bd9cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=pq$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />. By substituting these values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> into our expression for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/b/09bd235c74130dc18a0319991b4f80629aef8262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=pq-p-q+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"17\" />. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SFFT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SFFT\">SFFT</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/3532e6596f23db207a9307f79ec2efbbc40d89b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=(p-1)(q-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />. From the problem, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are both greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/7/3d76bd4a232f2d7216a6cd53196e566f1e086eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e48997b4cf18fa0772ca8b9c8c6dc6bebbb71b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(q-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> are necessarily positive. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, the product of these two positive terms, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c0541fdc5c16e85590d2d409472f16a57359c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(C) }must be greater than zero}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"237\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">Problem 43</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">Problem 45</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=